WEBVTT

00:00:56.306 --> 00:00:58.975
Mikono...

00:00:58.975 --> 00:01:00.477
Yeah...

00:01:07.776 --> 00:01:12.697
People's souls come full circle.
They are born into this world many times.

00:01:12.697 --> 00:01:16.034
Souls repeatedly drape
themselves with sorrows

00:01:16.034 --> 00:01:19.120
and those sorrows are
embraced by God in heaven.

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:20.413
That is...

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:23.750
That is what we call glorious rationality.

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:28.421
However, his soul veered from this rationality

00:01:28.421 --> 00:01:31.800
and aimed at a higher place.

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:33.718
We know this because...

00:01:33.718 --> 00:01:39.099
...the body of our last child is not here.

00:01:39.099 --> 00:01:41.851
What this means is that...

00:01:41.851 --> 00:01:45.063
...you need not place your hopes
and dreams in your next life,

00:01:45.063 --> 00:01:48.149
because Altair will never cease to exist.

00:01:49.234 --> 00:01:52.028
We need not fear.

00:01:52.028 --> 00:01:55.323
Our last child taught us...

00:01:56.408 --> 00:02:01.329
...that we are living in a miracle.

00:02:05.083 --> 00:02:07.460
What nonsense...

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:10.755
Altair is already in its final years,
as we can't produce offspring.

00:02:10.755 --> 00:02:15.844
On top of that, Iron Sea's power
output has been getting unstable.

00:02:15.844 --> 00:02:19.389
Deceiving the public through
sophistry has its limits.

00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:22.809
Mykage! Enough of your treachery!

00:02:22.809 --> 00:02:26.438
His infiltration this time
brought us some splendid news.

00:02:26.438 --> 00:02:30.316
How dare you say that
when you sacrificed Jin?!

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:34.863
What he gave Altair was quite considerable...

00:02:34.863 --> 00:02:39.034
So much so that his life was a fair price for it.

00:02:39.034 --> 00:02:40.285
What?!

00:02:40.285 --> 00:02:43.371
He did damage to the den of Rare Iguras.

00:02:43.371 --> 00:02:47.000
He made contacts with the
candidates for the true Eve.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:53.548
And the reincarnation of
Solar Wing has finally appeared.

00:02:54.716 --> 00:03:02.474
Jin's soul must be shivering with joy
at realizing the outcome of his actions.

00:03:02.474 --> 00:03:10.106
Yes, he might be reincarnated next
as the "first child" of new Altair.

00:03:15.487 --> 00:03:18.573
So your true goal is, after all...

00:03:21.493 --> 00:03:26.539
Jin... Don't forgive me... Don't forgive Altair.

00:03:28.083 --> 00:03:31.670
"Beyond an Individual"

00:03:38.718 --> 00:03:41.846
After this, we'll move to
the cemetery in Neo Stanley.

00:03:41.846 --> 00:03:43.223
--The school boat
--Where's Yunoha?

00:03:43.223 --> 00:03:45.433
--will arrive at 2 o'clock, so please make sure...
--She isn't coming out of her room.

00:03:45.433 --> 00:03:47.602
She's been invisible the entire time.

00:03:47.602 --> 00:03:49.020
I see.

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:53.108
I wonder if she's going to continue
shutting herself in there like that...

00:03:53.108 --> 00:03:59.030
I do understand how she feels.
If I lost someone dear to me...

00:04:07.664 --> 00:04:09.624
Yunoha...

00:04:09.624 --> 00:04:12.585
Mikono Suzushiro.

00:04:12.585 --> 00:04:14.754
Supreme Commander Fudo...

00:04:17.882 --> 00:04:21.052
For some reason, I don't
feel comfortable around him.

00:04:21.052 --> 00:04:24.389
Take Yunoha Suroor out of her room.

00:04:24.389 --> 00:04:27.892
I can't! I want to give
her some space right now.

00:04:27.892 --> 00:04:32.689
The act of Gattai, in which you connect yourself
with others, is a requirement at this academy.

00:04:32.689 --> 00:04:37.193
Selfishly sinking into the depths
of loneliness is not allowed.

00:04:37.193 --> 00:04:38.528
"Selfishly"?!

00:04:38.528 --> 00:04:39.821
You don't remember?

00:04:39.821 --> 00:04:43.825
Yunoha's Element power is Disappearance.

00:04:43.825 --> 00:04:47.746
It wouldn't be surprising at all
if she lost control of her power

00:04:47.746 --> 00:04:51.875
over the loss of Jin Musou
and tried to destroy herself.

00:05:00.717 --> 00:05:02.510
She hasn't changed...

00:05:19.652 --> 00:05:22.864
Yunoha, may I come in?

00:05:22.864 --> 00:05:24.616
Mikono...

00:05:31.122 --> 00:05:34.376
I thought you should try to eat something.

00:05:35.502 --> 00:05:37.170
I'm sorry.

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:40.507
Oh, you don't have to force yourself to eat.

00:05:40.507 --> 00:05:42.300
I'll leave this here.

00:05:43.802 --> 00:05:46.971
Yunoha's presence is fading.

00:05:46.971 --> 00:05:48.973
What should I say to her?

00:05:51.142 --> 00:05:55.605
Jin asked me...

00:05:55.605 --> 00:05:58.483
...to go with him.

00:05:58.483 --> 00:06:02.570
If I had agreed to that...

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:04.239
...he could've...

00:06:06.116 --> 00:06:09.494
Oh, no... I feel her less and less.

00:06:09.494 --> 00:06:11.287
Unless something is done, she'll...

00:06:16.001 --> 00:06:18.420
Let's go, Yunoha.

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:21.214
Let's go with everyone.

00:06:21.214 --> 00:06:24.509
N-No! I don't want to go!

00:06:25.844 --> 00:06:30.682
I don't want to say... I don't
want to say goodbye to Jin!

00:06:31.975 --> 00:06:34.436
You don't have to say goodbye!

00:06:34.436 --> 00:06:37.522
I don't... I don't want to say it, either...

00:06:37.522 --> 00:06:40.525
To Jin... or to you, either!

00:06:40.525 --> 00:06:44.487
I like you, Yunoha! You're dear to me!

00:06:44.487 --> 00:06:47.073
So... please...

00:06:58.585 --> 00:07:00.086
Jin...

00:07:05.342 --> 00:07:11.056
♪ My heart races through the future ♪

00:07:11.056 --> 00:07:15.852
--Mom... are you in the world where Jin lived?
--♪ Cross over the black abyss ♪

00:07:15.852 --> 00:07:19.689
♪ and come get me ♪

00:07:19.689 --> 00:07:22.108
I... I...

00:07:40.752 --> 00:07:43.338
Finally...

00:07:43.338 --> 00:07:46.424
Everyone's finally started noticing...

00:07:46.424 --> 00:07:49.469
...that we're in a life-or-death situation.

00:07:50.595 --> 00:07:53.598
We have to appreciate those
friends of ours who died.

00:07:53.598 --> 00:07:56.851
How dare you...?! How little
do you think of people's lives?!

00:08:03.191 --> 00:08:04.943
Sorry.

00:08:07.237 --> 00:08:08.988
You guys, don't tell me...

00:08:08.988 --> 00:08:10.323
I'm sorry.

00:08:10.323 --> 00:08:14.035
We thought we might want
to quit school and go home.

00:08:14.035 --> 00:08:16.621
Was your determination that shallow?!

00:08:17.747 --> 00:08:21.793
We are Elements who have been
chosen to protect this planet!

00:08:21.793 --> 00:08:24.671
To think you've forgotten that pride...!

00:08:24.671 --> 00:08:26.631
Stop it, Mix.

00:08:26.631 --> 00:08:28.633
But it's frustrating!

00:08:28.633 --> 00:08:32.512
We've worked very hard and gone
through difficult training all this time!

00:08:32.512 --> 00:08:35.265
Andy? Don't tell me you too...

00:08:37.308 --> 00:08:42.105
I'll remain at the academy.
What'll happen if we leave?

00:08:42.105 --> 00:08:44.482
Everyone will fall...

00:08:44.482 --> 00:08:48.570
Everyone will be sucked in... to that huge hole.

00:08:49.654 --> 00:08:54.617
I refuse to fall into a hole
that someone else dug!

00:08:54.617 --> 00:08:56.202
Andy...

00:09:41.623 --> 00:09:44.584
Andy W. Hall.

00:09:44.584 --> 00:09:47.379
Dig holes.

00:09:47.379 --> 00:09:48.880
What?!

00:09:56.763 --> 00:10:00.934
This is a nightmare. There are...
There are so many holes.

00:10:02.352 --> 00:10:04.771
Thank you, Andy.

00:10:06.815 --> 00:10:10.402
What are you going to use these holes for?

00:10:10.402 --> 00:10:12.153
Altair...

00:10:15.699 --> 00:10:20.245
Jin Musou came from the world called Altair.

00:10:20.245 --> 00:10:21.579
Altair?

00:10:21.579 --> 00:10:27.669
Furthermore, from the data he left,
Altair's goal has become clear.

00:10:27.669 --> 00:10:32.048
They are trying to kidnap female Elements.

00:10:34.801 --> 00:10:39.639
The battle against Altair is
expected to further intensify.

00:10:39.639 --> 00:10:44.811
This battle will probably produce
more dead to be buried here.

00:10:44.811 --> 00:10:48.189
In order to face that battle,

00:10:48.189 --> 00:10:50.316
I want you to bury yourselves in here, too.

00:10:50.316 --> 00:10:52.986
--"Bury"?
--Don't tell me...

00:10:52.986 --> 00:10:56.990
I'll call it "Grave Training"!

00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:11.755
Why?! In the graveyard where
we just buried our friends?

00:11:11.755 --> 00:11:14.758
Getting buried is crazy enough,
and now you're telling us to do it in a grave?!

00:11:14.758 --> 00:11:17.469
--I absolutely refuse!
--H-Hey...

00:11:17.469 --> 00:11:19.763
Commander, that's quite...

00:11:19.763 --> 00:11:21.306
You're terrible!

00:11:21.306 --> 00:11:22.766
--Mikono?
--Mikono!

00:11:22.766 --> 00:11:26.644
Everyone's hurt right now.
What you're saying is crazy!

00:11:30.648 --> 00:11:34.652
You guys are bound by your lives.

00:11:34.652 --> 00:11:36.821
By sleeping together with the dead,

00:11:36.821 --> 00:11:40.283
your desire to live will increase remarkably.

00:11:40.283 --> 00:11:46.289
Worldly thoughts, wicked thoughts,
love, obsession, deep-seated grudges...

00:11:46.289 --> 00:11:50.460
All these things take the freedom
of the soul away from you

00:11:50.460 --> 00:11:54.881
and become a hindrance to you
on the life-or-death battlefield.

00:11:56.049 --> 00:11:59.135
You have to die once here.

00:11:59.135 --> 00:12:02.097
"Death"

00:12:03.390 --> 00:12:05.058
"Die"?

00:12:05.058 --> 00:12:10.313
Let your attachment to living
burst out and then cut it off.

00:12:10.313 --> 00:12:13.983
Check with your own eyes...

00:12:13.983 --> 00:12:16.778
...what lies beyond temporary death!

00:12:18.196 --> 00:12:19.406
That sounds interesting.

00:12:19.406 --> 00:12:21.241
Shrade!

00:12:21.241 --> 00:12:25.203
I'm practically already in a coffin.

00:12:25.203 --> 00:12:29.749
It's not too bad of an idea to
practice for my impending death.

00:12:31.376 --> 00:12:33.294
Wait, Shrade!

00:12:33.294 --> 00:12:35.463
Yunoha?

00:12:35.463 --> 00:12:38.591
I want to be by his side.

00:12:38.591 --> 00:12:42.220
I want to be as close to Jin as possible.

00:12:46.349 --> 00:12:51.271
I guess I have no choice but to fill
this unpleasant hole with myself.

00:12:53.314 --> 00:12:58.319
Filling the holes I dug?
That's exactly like killing me.

00:13:02.449 --> 00:13:05.243
I won't do it! I'll never do it!

00:13:05.243 --> 00:13:08.163
That's fine. <i>You </i>don't have to.

00:13:08.163 --> 00:13:10.790
That eye that looks as if it
sees through everything...!

00:13:12.417 --> 00:13:14.085
I hate it!

00:13:15.545 --> 00:13:18.381
That's fine.

00:13:18.381 --> 00:13:19.966
Mikono...

00:13:19.966 --> 00:13:21.551
Amata!

00:13:39.319 --> 00:13:41.071
It's dark...

00:13:41.071 --> 00:13:43.448
I can't see anything.

00:13:43.448 --> 00:13:47.827
How quiet it is in here. Complete silence!

00:13:47.827 --> 00:13:52.791
No, there <i>are </i>sounds. I sense
insects crawling in the soil.

00:13:55.502 --> 00:13:59.005
They dig holes and move around.

00:13:59.005 --> 00:14:00.340
It's unpleasant!

00:14:00.340 --> 00:14:04.719
I feel as though maggots
will invade my pores and...

00:14:04.719 --> 00:14:09.641
I feel as if my body is going
to become frail and crumble...

00:14:11.226 --> 00:14:14.479
As if my body's going to rot...

00:14:16.147 --> 00:14:20.318
If I rot... If I rot and become
able to return to the soil...

00:14:20.318 --> 00:14:24.531
...will Jin and I be able to become one?

00:14:24.531 --> 00:14:27.701
I'm scared... Returning to the soil?

00:14:27.701 --> 00:14:30.495
I'll stay like this and be unable
to go back above ground?

00:14:30.495 --> 00:14:31.955
Don't be afraid!

00:14:31.955 --> 00:14:34.165
No... No...!

00:14:34.165 --> 00:14:36.501
Don't be afraid. This hole is...

00:14:36.501 --> 00:14:40.422
I can't... N-Nooo!

00:14:44.342 --> 00:14:47.012
--I can't do it after all.
--This is crazy!

00:14:47.012 --> 00:14:48.263
Supreme Commander!

00:14:48.263 --> 00:14:49.305
This is just...

00:14:49.305 --> 00:14:50.974
Silence!

00:14:52.475 --> 00:15:00.025
Ahh... The sinful wingless ones
are struggling in the deep darkness.

00:15:00.025 --> 00:15:07.032
Kagura, you too want to enjoy the
journey to Hades with them, right?

00:15:10.326 --> 00:15:15.540
Now, go ahead and let
yourself be buried, Kagura.

00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:19.377
Let yourself be... buried.

00:15:23.131 --> 00:15:26.843
Even if this is crazy, I can't get out...

00:15:26.843 --> 00:15:31.556
That's right, this is a hole Andy dug.

00:15:31.556 --> 00:15:34.017
A hole I dug...

00:15:34.017 --> 00:15:40.690
When I think of it that way, I'm not scared...
even if I can't see anything.

00:15:40.690 --> 00:15:45.987
I can't see anything...
not even my Despair Prediction...

00:15:45.987 --> 00:15:49.783
I wonder why I could see it that time...

00:15:52.160 --> 00:15:57.916
If Mikono is a reincarnation of Silffy, Amata,

00:15:57.916 --> 00:16:01.461
Mikono won't choose you.

00:16:01.461 --> 00:16:04.839
I wasn't chosen...

00:16:04.839 --> 00:16:10.929
After she left me... I didn't care if I died.

00:16:10.929 --> 00:16:14.933
Maybe it's okay for me to die.

00:16:14.933 --> 00:16:17.686
A world without Jin...

00:16:17.686 --> 00:16:21.648
I don't want a world like this.

00:16:21.648 --> 00:16:23.149
Hm?

00:16:24.150 --> 00:16:25.735
Yunoha?!

00:16:27.153 --> 00:16:29.489
Yunoha's presence is fading!

00:16:33.868 --> 00:16:38.289
Amata's power, Flying. Zessica's power, Twist.

00:16:38.289 --> 00:16:42.752
Shrade's Sounds. Cayenne's Despair.

00:16:42.752 --> 00:16:46.339
And Yunoha's power, Disappearance.

00:16:48.174 --> 00:16:53.221
All of their feelings are
running amok. As it stands...

00:16:53.221 --> 00:16:54.973
No, Yunoha!

00:16:54.973 --> 00:16:57.642
No, Mikono!

00:16:57.642 --> 00:17:00.353
We were finally able to become close...

00:17:00.353 --> 00:17:03.815
I thought we could finally be connected...

00:17:03.815 --> 00:17:06.317
Why?!

00:17:06.317 --> 00:17:10.196
Come back one more time... Hey!

00:17:12.657 --> 00:17:15.326
No.

00:17:15.326 --> 00:17:17.162
Amata?

00:17:18.663 --> 00:17:22.042
If I was born, I'd be left behind again.

00:17:28.006 --> 00:17:32.469
No! I don't want to be left
behind by anyone again.

00:17:32.469 --> 00:17:37.682
Left behind... Amata will be left behind.

00:17:37.682 --> 00:17:41.019
I can't... I can't take it anymore.

00:17:41.019 --> 00:17:43.438
I don't want to be left behind.

00:17:43.438 --> 00:17:49.402
I want to stay here...
Stay here with Jin like this.

00:17:51.279 --> 00:17:55.784
I don't want to be born ever again.

00:17:55.784 --> 00:17:58.536
Living alone is...

00:17:58.536 --> 00:18:00.455
...hard...

00:18:00.455 --> 00:18:02.374
Living is...

00:18:02.374 --> 00:18:05.043
Stop it! Stop it!

00:18:06.544 --> 00:18:08.546
Don't say that!

00:18:12.550 --> 00:18:13.385
What's this?

00:18:13.385 --> 00:18:16.721
Mikono Suzushiro. This is the power you have.

00:18:16.721 --> 00:18:18.848
What?

00:18:18.848 --> 00:18:23.436
People don't die only when
their lives come to an end.

00:18:23.436 --> 00:18:27.315
Just like your hair comes out
and leaves fall and wither away,

00:18:27.315 --> 00:18:30.568
the cells in your body,
your consciousness, and your mind

00:18:30.568 --> 00:18:34.155
also die each and every moment.

00:18:34.155 --> 00:18:37.951
Each and every moment...

00:18:37.951 --> 00:18:41.121
"Old"
However, when you get caught up and fixated on your old self,

00:18:41.121 --> 00:18:42.747
However, when you get caught up and fixated on your old self,

00:18:42.747 --> 00:18:43.915
"Old"
However, when you get caught up and fixated on your old self,

00:18:43.915 --> 00:18:45.792
"Old"
you'll get separated from others,

00:18:45.792 --> 00:18:46.251
"Old" "Fixation"
you'll get separated from others,

00:18:46.251 --> 00:18:47.752
"Old" "Fixation"
cut off from the flow of the great universe.

00:18:47.752 --> 00:18:49.713
"Individual"
cut off from the flow of the great universe.

00:18:50.255 --> 00:18:52.340
Mikono Suzushiro.

00:18:52.340 --> 00:18:57.012
Your power connects those separated people once again.

00:18:57.012 --> 00:18:57.387
"Individual"
Your power connects those separated people once again.

00:18:57.387 --> 00:18:59.764
"Individual"
The power to connect?

00:18:59.764 --> 00:19:01.016
"Individual"
That's right. That fixation on your old self...

00:19:01.016 --> 00:19:03.560
"Individual"
That's right. That fixation on your old self...

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:07.397
"Individual"
By thriving on that corpse, you'll grow...

00:19:07.397 --> 00:19:10.942
...just like hyphae of mushrooms...

00:19:10.942 --> 00:19:14.779
At the bottom of the ground
that you cannot see,

00:19:14.779 --> 00:19:17.282
in the threshold between life and death,

00:19:17.282 --> 00:19:21.995
your power connects the separated souls.

00:19:26.583 --> 00:19:31.129
For ten thousand years and two
thousand more, I've loved you.

00:19:31.129 --> 00:19:33.214
Can't be...!

00:19:33.214 --> 00:19:38.345
After eight thousand years,
I loved you even more.

00:19:38.345 --> 00:19:40.597
This voice...

00:19:40.597 --> 00:19:43.099
I've been alone all this time.

00:19:44.225 --> 00:19:46.686
I didn't care about anyone else.

00:19:46.686 --> 00:19:48.980
It really is Jin!

00:19:48.980 --> 00:19:51.024
But Yunoha...

00:19:51.024 --> 00:19:53.068
After I came to know you,

00:19:53.068 --> 00:19:58.490
I wished to connect with others.

00:19:59.699 --> 00:20:05.705
So... don't stop the flow of life, Yunoha.

00:20:05.705 --> 00:20:08.375
And everyone...

00:20:08.375 --> 00:20:10.669
Everyone...

00:20:10.669 --> 00:20:13.046
I've realized that I'm not alone.

00:20:14.464 --> 00:20:21.262
Our lives definitely don't
belong just to our own selves.

00:20:21.262 --> 00:20:22.931
Our lives...

00:20:25.308 --> 00:20:27.852
...don't belong just to us.

00:20:27.852 --> 00:20:29.396
That's right.

00:20:30.438 --> 00:20:34.359
Our lives transcend life and death,

00:20:34.359 --> 00:20:36.820
and now, they're being connected!

00:20:39.155 --> 00:20:42.158
Oh, how soft the soil is!

00:20:42.158 --> 00:20:46.246
Could it be that the corpses
have become our cradle?

00:20:46.246 --> 00:20:51.167
This feels just like being held in
my mom's arms when I was a baby.

00:20:51.167 --> 00:20:56.464
Yes, if I hadn't been born, I wouldn't
have encountered feelings like this.

00:20:57.716 --> 00:21:02.721
If I hadn't been born, I wouldn't have
been able to meet everyone and Jin.

00:21:02.721 --> 00:21:07.142
That's right. It isn't scary outside the hole.

00:21:07.142 --> 00:21:09.686
Of course, dangerous things happen.

00:21:09.686 --> 00:21:14.566
But there's the same warmth
there that I feel inside the hole.

00:21:14.566 --> 00:21:20.905
If we try to obtain warmth, we get
hurt and receive pain. But even so...

00:21:20.905 --> 00:21:25.076
There are sounds produced only
between the death and rebirth.

00:21:27.495 --> 00:21:29.289
That's right!

00:21:29.289 --> 00:21:31.750
Don't be afraid, everyone!

00:21:31.750 --> 00:21:34.377
I'll always be waiting here...

00:21:35.795 --> 00:21:41.634
I’m waiting for you all to
be born again right now!

00:21:45.096 --> 00:21:49.351
In the flow of time, the place where
you die each and every moment

00:21:49.351 --> 00:21:52.312
and you are reincarnated
each and every moment...

00:21:52.312 --> 00:21:55.273
Where something is born from nothing...

00:21:55.273 --> 00:21:57.984
That is "now"!

00:21:57.984 --> 00:21:59.402
Now?!

00:21:59.402 --> 00:22:02.405
Use your heart to connect
with the moment that is "now"!

00:22:07.619 --> 00:22:09.454
"Now"
"Heart"

00:22:09.454 --> 00:22:12.957
"Desire"

00:22:13.583 --> 00:22:16.920
This is precisely the Nenshin Gattai.

00:22:23.635 --> 00:22:25.428
Is this...

00:22:25.428 --> 00:22:26.930
Mikono?

00:22:28.890 --> 00:22:30.684
Happy birthday!

00:22:47.992 --> 00:22:49.494
No...

00:22:56.167 --> 00:23:01.631
<i>It wasn't stolen away by the wind</i>

00:23:01.631 --> 00:23:04.509
<i>With the resolve that we cannot turn back,</i>

00:23:04.509 --> 00:23:12.308
<i>we accept the tragedy</i>

00:23:12.308 --> 00:23:17.022
<i>A cavern lies where my heart once was</i>

00:23:17.022 --> 00:23:19.607
<i>If I was older,</i>

00:23:19.607 --> 00:23:25.280
<i>would I have been able</i>
<i>to save you and the future?</i>

00:23:25.280 --> 00:23:32.579
<i>Having only a single means</i>
<i>to protect the one you love,</i>

00:23:32.579 --> 00:23:39.419
<i>you become lost and drift in the sky</i>

00:23:39.419 --> 00:23:47.135
<i>I'll never be able to meet anyone</i>
<i>who means more to me than you</i>

00:23:47.135 --> 00:23:53.600
<i>A long flare that struggles against the moon</i>

00:23:53.600 --> 00:24:00.148
<i>A story that ends even before it begins</i>

00:24:00.148 --> 00:24:06.112
<i>A melody that seals away</i>
<i>the vulnerable tenderness</i>

00:24:06.112 --> 00:24:09.157
<i>The more I play it, the more I sing it...</i>

00:24:09.157 --> 00:24:14.621
<i>It almost destroys me how much...</i>

00:24:14.621 --> 00:24:21.544
<i>...I long for you</i>

00:24:23.755 --> 00:24:27.217
To think that they've become this
strong by getting buried in a grave...

00:24:27.217 --> 00:24:29.052
But I won't be outdone!

00:24:29.052 --> 00:24:33.264
I'll turn my usual zap into a whirring noogie!

00:24:33.723 --> 00:24:35.141
"Next Episode 'Love Beasts'"
Next on <i>Aquarion Evol</i>!

00:24:35.141 --> 00:24:37.120
"Next Episode 'Love Beasts'"
"Love Beasts."
